<% layout("Layouts/boilerplate") %>
<section class="container-fluid px-lg-4 page-space"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Responsible analytical system</span><h1>Transparent methods. Deliberate limits.</h1><p>How the prototype turns simulated inputs into reviewable operational evidence.</p></div>
  <div class="row g-3 methodology" id="decision-flow"><div class="col-lg-7"><article class="glass-card"><h2>Decision flow</h2><div class="flow"><div><b>1</b><span><strong>Separate inputs</strong>Physical cash, provider balances, pseudonymized transactions</span></div><i>→</i><div><b>2</b><span><strong>Deterministic decisions</strong>Runway, time-window clustering, feed-quality confidence</span></div><i>→</i><div><b>3</b><span><strong>Governed assistance</strong>Optional OpenAI language, human owner, allowed transitions, audit trail</span></div></div></article></div><div class="col-lg-5"><article class="glass-card h-100"><h2>Provider boundary</h2><p class="muted">Balances are shown together for situational awareness but remain logically isolated. Recommendations never imply conversion or control across providers.</p><div class="boundary-visual"><span>bKash ledger</span><span>Nagad ledger</span><span>Rocket ledger</span></div></article></div></div>
  <div class="row g-3 mt-1"><div class="col-md-6"><article class="glass-card h-100"><span class="eyebrow">Evaluation evidence</span><h2>Measured fixture results</h2><div class="metric-table"><div><span>Shared-cash warning lead time</span><b><%= data.cashForecast.shortageHour %> simulated hours</b></div><div><span>Injected repeated-pattern recall</span><b>1 / 1 fixture</b></div><div><span>Negative anomaly fixtures</span><b>3 / 3 unflagged</b></div><div><span>Evidence + confidence coverage</span><b><%= data.alerts.filter(a=>a.evidence.length && Number.isFinite(a.confidence)).length %> / <%= data.alerts.length %> alerts</b></div><div><span>Persistence mode</span><b><%= persistence.mode %></b></div></div><small class="muted">Measured only on documented synthetic fixtures; these are not production accuracy claims.</small></article></div><div class="col-md-6"><article class="glass-card h-100"><span class="eyebrow">Known limitations</span><h2>What this does not claim</h2><ul class="limitations"><li>No real provider APIs, balances, identities, or credentials.</li><li>No settlement, wallet conversion, blocking, or financial action.</li><li>Forecast thresholds need calibration on approved historical data.</li><li>Repeated amounts may be legitimate peak demand; human review is required.</li><li>Confidence is a heuristic engineering indicator, not a calibrated probability.</li><li>OpenAI generates language only; deterministic code owns signals and severity.</li></ul></article></div></div>
</section>
